Package: MGWPR
Type: Package
Title: Multiscale Geographically Weighted Panel Regression
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: Iron Hong("MGWPR", "Maintainers", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "righttocity123@gmail.com")
Description: Fits pooled and individual fixed-effects multiscale geographically
    weighted panel regression models using spatial kernel weighting and
    predictor-specific bandwidths. Includes iterative backfitting, bandwidth
    selection by leave-one-location-out cross-validation, model summaries, and
    spatial coefficient, context-effect, and significance maps. Provides
    coefficient-surface accuracy metrics and conditional local inference for
    pooled and fixed-effects fits. Supports Gaussian and pooled binomial
    responses, five spatial kernels, sf-based mapping, and spatial-panel
    diagnostic procedures. Includes a reproducible spatial panel data
    simulation utility with known coefficient surfaces, and MGWR estimation
    through the GWmodel package.
